  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Linda Geary visited the studios of many CCA faculty and alumni. "During my sabbatical year in 2011, I set out to visit 100 artists' studios in the Bay Area ... [T]he list grew organically to also include writers, curators, and gallerists. ... I asked each person to pick six colors ... Later I realized that I was asking everyone to make a painting while we talked. After each visit, I took notes. Over the course of several months I condensed the notes down to a list of words, which represents my subjective recollection of each conversation. ... The words are the remains of 100 exchanges, the collages reflections of a momentary impulse. Together they form a picture of a year in conversation."--Introduction.</subfield>
  </datafield>
